            <p>DIVD’s response—limiting the breach through network segmentation and rapid incident response—demonstrates the importance of proactive controls. However, the damage already done highlights the urgency of integrating AI security into our broader cybersecurity frameworks. Governance must keep pace with the speed and scale of these emerging threats.</p>
